OL,3,AUS House blocks bid to impeach Defence
OL,4,ASecretary Pete Hegseth, for now
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his first news briefing from the
OL,7,FPentagon in six months, Hegseth called
OL,8,Fthe impeachment effort a "farce" and
OL,9,F"sabotage".
OL,11,FThe bid to find the cabinet secretary
OL,12,Fguilty of misconduct and ultimately
OL,13,Fremove him from office was seen as a
OL,14,Flong shot as it could have required a
OL,15,Fnumber of other Republicans to defy
OL,16,FPresident Donald Trump.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
